            "description": {
              "value": "You immediately learn two of the following rituals: astral projection, call spirit, commune, commune with nature, legend lore, or planar binding. When you perform any ritual, you can incorporate harrow cards into the ritual to gain a +2 status bonus to all skill checks made to resolve the effects of the ritual. You can take this feat more than once; each time you do, you learn two new rituals"
